# --- Original retail game files: NOT redistributed in this repo ---
# DinoPark Tycoon (c) 1993 Manley & Associates / MECC. The game is long out of
# print (abandonware), but copyright most likely still subsists (Houghton Mifflin
# Harcourt via the MECC -> SoftKey -> TLC -> Mattel -> Riverdeep/HMH chain). To be
# safe for a public/private repo we keep ALL original binaries and assets
# local-only. Bring your own copy and drop the files into original/ yourself.
original/
Dinopark_Tycoon_1993.zip
*.EXE
*.exe
*.PIC
*.ACT
*.ABT
*.XMI
*.COM
*.ADV

